From: marvin <marvin@local>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:20:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] v0 build tooling: TestArena batch builder + preemptive
 compile fixes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Assets/Editor/BuildTestArena.cs: batch-mode builder for the TestArena
  scene (BuildTestArena.Build) — creates Target tag, URP pipeline asset,
  generated InputActionAsset, Rifle WeaponData, geometry (ground, 15/30
  ramps, 8-step staircase, 3 low walls, 2 platforms), 5 target dummies,
  full player prefab, uGUI HUD; and BuildTestArena.BuildWebGL which builds
  the WebGL player to ~/workspace/cod-mobile-webgl/
- Fix: IInputProvider lookup helper (GetComponent<T>() doesn't resolve
  interfaces); PlayerMovement/PlayerCamera/WeaponController use it
- Fix: HUDController de-TMP'd to legacy UnityEngine.UI.Text (TextMeshPro
  not in Packages/manifest.json)
---
